  "narrative": "Even if this one shares some similarities with the [REDACTED_MALWARE] downloader, such as the persistence mechanism and the splash window, it adds more granularity to the reconnaissance phase than that of the [REDACTED_MALWARE] downloader. PDFmyURL - online url to pdf conversion AutoIt downloader The AutoIt downloader is another layer of the reconnaissance phase during an infection of the victim computer. From this point onwards, two scenarios are possible: in the first one, the [REDACTED_MALWARE] downloader is the first stage and the second stage – which is the AutoIt downloader – is a lightweight downloader.",
